{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：19:30 2026-10-08 HKT</p>\n\n<p>現年32歲的2016年香港小姐冠軍馮盈盈（Crystal），入行十年以來一直以美貌與智慧兼備著稱。早前她毅然重返校園自我增值，順利取得香港大學一級榮譽碩士學位，知性形象深入人心。近日，這位「學霸女神」在社交平台罕有大解放，分享了一輯極致唯美的性感寫真照。相中她換上一襲超性感純白透視喱士低胸晚裝，大方展現凹凸有致的豐滿身材，旋即在網上掀起洗版式熱話。</p>\n<h2>馮盈盈低胸裝喱士透視</h2>\n<p>馮盈盈當天的造型仙氣與性感並重，一襲純白吊帶晚裝剪裁大膽俐落，胸前深V低胸設計令其豐滿上圍與深邃線條展露無遺，白滑美背與纖幼手臂同樣吸睛。晚裝整體巧妙融入半透視蕾絲工藝，若隱若現間將其曼妙身段勾勒得淋漓盡致；下半身裙擺則綴滿層次豐富的輕柔羽毛裝飾，隨風輕擺飄逸靈動，宛如墜入凡間的精靈。除了身段惹火，她的顏值亦再度升級，精緻無瑕的透薄底妝搭配粉嫩微醺的仙氣眼唇妝容，秀髮隨性披散，舉手投足間流露典雅而誘人的女神氣場。</p>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈大晒火辣身材，俘虜不少粉絲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e5e89e724c829ae949fe7d2516711df4/2026-04/3550434849679162962_233098729.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈身材非常好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/38cc1aa0d6754842f49e3eb00dcf704a/2025-07/crystalfyy_1752837788_3679392505235283783_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈罕晒透視低胸羽毛裝，性感程度爆燈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f19eaeea7bd8a9aee91c0ea09c6d0f6e/2026-10/1_12_30.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈透視低胸羽毛裝用喱士設計。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8ffefc69e3d0d6dd8155d6bd7623cceb/2026-10/2_11_28.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈超性感狀態被大讚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7f8aaba972fcd34ac391842c8e7c9637/2026-10/3_24_29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈身材超Fit。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1020c15efe3f6d2a3f47fd6bcd4cdb64/2026-10/4_8_23.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈為自己澄清「冇走樣」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/847c7ef6ff619fb34c1cdaf7cf07a813/2025-07/crystalfyy_1752837788_3679392505243851751_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈大晒美背。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dd447a9fec8e29acab963305412f9cac/2025-07/crystalfyy_1752837788_3679392505302565339_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈有好多時間去旅遊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9f6150c0eeeee963ae065e94bf27ae2b/2025-07/crystalfyy_1752837788_3679392505520521374_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈分享水著靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b36b7885ec528e71c21562a2902786fd/2025-07/crystalfyy_1752837788_3679392505562565759_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈近年在晒身材方面非常大方。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/45fbd91eccac60e7395330af5edc2e32/2025-07/crystalfyy_1752837788_3679392505520545710_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈身材極火辣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ba88e48031a26fe6bb94d6852331a190/2025-10/6_4_15.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"網民指馮盈盈忽然撞樣張員瑛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1bff8aed83cea37376b82e551160e420/2025-10/7_4_20.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈上載多張性感泳照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/24aae2a43e141bc422e5bac002d7fcf9/2026-02/4_11_9.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈大派福利。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8e278c5568faa34bb5571fa1e9d69a94/2026-02/5_9_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈雙臂展開，完美展現出玲瓏有致的S形曲線，火辣身材一覽無遺。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8cb0741f968cfebf21a08eb5857d44b2/2026-02/6_8_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈浸在只有攝氏2度的冰水中，大方展示其驕人上圍和白滑肌膚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/80498b34e2e82b32e7dc36c0e72bd8ba/2026-02/7_7_7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"從高角度欣賞，馮盈盈在木桶中享受冰水療程，畫面極度吸睛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f614efeb6f6437a0cb7cfadcaf3fba89/2026-02/8_8_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈在公園進行戶外瑜伽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/97134d947da1ddf731e5f3c4deee79b2/2026-02/9_8_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈工作量大減。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0197cbdae42a63fc404c8ef4950ad2a8/2025-07/crystalfyy_1752837788_3679390631581159596_233098729_mp4_snapshot_00_12_648.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈近年曾停工專注學業。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/97edb91c4d9c009da4c2b705391b1741/2025-07/crystalfyy_1752837788_3679390631581159596_233098729_mp4_snapshot_00_13_830.jpg\"/>\n<h2>馮盈盈獲讚仙女下凡</h2>\n<p>這輯噴血福利照曝光後，隨即引來大批圈中好友與網民湧入留言區狂讚，紛紛留言大呼：「盈盈呢身造型好靚」、「索到呢」、「真係仙氣女神」、「身材完全藏不住」。由於晚裝的細緻透視剪裁極度吸睛，不少網民更搞笑坦承自己「不自覺失守」，紛紛留言打趣：「對唔住真係忍唔住係咁zoom大張相睇」、「放大睇到眼都花埋」、「細節位太厲害」，場面相當搞笑。</p>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈早前分享多張靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c2cbf437a5ad4210dd2459670c180e71/2025-07/crystalfyy_1752145637_3673586326416397453_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈的天使造型。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/389a398d1b1f5321628c1c7688b80408/2025-07/crystalfyy_1752145637_3673586326424852355_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有網民將這輯照片與她與樂易玲的合照作對比。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/17d621a159207cb93305987df9f9bdbf/2025-07/crystalfyy_1752145637_3673586326550724610_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈有仙氣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2e7d31607e9d6ee3dce9c12f131372ab/2025-07/crystalfyy_1752145637_3673586326450187267_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈的造型獲盛讚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/436f30065a2fd1a41babb47b970fc9f0/2025-07/crystalfyy_1752145637_3673586326550747796_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈早前分享多張靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4d44c38be09e970231ff435f16a51b93/2025-07/crystalfyy_1752145637_3673586326710230761_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈近年越來越靚，打扮仙氣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1e214b62193fa329646788f4e46b98cc/2024-11/crystalfyy_459913691_18459910978010730_8805719530961411205_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈笑言自己是史上穿最多衫的內衣廣告。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9ccb5b0f19407ccd8527849b858ba39e/2025-12/crystalfyy_1766030422_3790060344891851990_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈澄清與TVB還有合約，表示大家可繼續找她開工。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/508fc2324e9c90669bc9e304ce1cb869/2025-12/crystalfyy_1766030422_3790060345026030853_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈近日再有「升CUP」內衣照流出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0795dd9ed0781dc5b6b364e046f9d840/2025-12/crystalfyy_1766030422_3790060345026036789_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈笑言內衣廣告已是極限。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d6fc00276537044d98f862306ae77c0a/2025-12/crystalfyy_1766030422_3790060345177033370_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈表示最重要是身材勻稱，展露曲線已很迷人，不會用其他手法造假。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/13eb1233e0bf9643c7aba2b170256f56/2025-12/crystalfyy_1766030422_3790060345185430890_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈的新一輯內衣照，再次震撼網民眼球。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e98af0680a1bd5b01b90b886f7fdf68e/2025-12/crystalfyy_1766030422_3790060345185447935_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈再有噴血級內衣靚相流出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6547e72eea52e0410e8f49fc4d9ef484/2025-12/crystalfyy_1765858698_3788619812676199432_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈展示出穿上內衣的不同效果。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f373c99924bceccb96c88d44cf0f706e/2025-11/crystalfyy_1763352905_3767599701328853685_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈大騷深長事業線。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/06ea7b4b1af9b2bebd5068c5f4110460/2025-11/crystalfyy_1763352905_3767599701337243426_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈拍攝這輯內衣廣告靚相，獲網民激讚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9a1ae8a3fefa5189a1a8822aea00ebba/2025-11/crystalfyy_1763352905_3767599701446292832_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈穿上這套較為簡約的內衣時，上圍即時連跳幾Cup，看得網民嘩嘩聲！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0d9850e8db55aa5dbe8422d0818f1618/2025-11/crystalfyy_1763352905_3767599701454654060_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈的內衣廣告相，網民大讚超級sexy。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/18565293277d29b8065133a81712a6c6/2025-11/crystalfyy_1763352905_3767599701614043668_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈獲得內衣品牌品牌青睞，邀請拍攝廣告。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2bf2c80a19b8157cb93d23eff875bf0a/2025-11/crystalfyy_1763352905_3767599701714707796_233098729.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T11:38:19.437869+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":597,"images":41,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}